# API Changelog v1 vs. v1


## API Changes

### POST /pets/{petId}
-  for the `path` request parameter `petId`, the exclusiveMaximum was unset from `13.00`
-  added the media type `application/xml` for the response with the status `500`
-  added the media type `text/plain` for the response with the status `500`
-  the ``tick`` response's property default value `麨챗ᒏᣟꙋ钸蠠彆` was removed for the status `200`






